<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;" face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Good Afternoon,&nbsp;</span></font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style=""><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">We have received approval for 2 options:</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">A. We will settle the balance with a 1 time payment of $3,000.00 which can be made via credit card if necessary.</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">B.&nbsp;</font><font face="arial">We can stop the payment for 2 weeks, run half payments for 2 weeks and then resume the full payment until the full remaining balance is repaid.</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Let me know which you would like to move forward with.</font></p></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Thank you,&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial">Modification Department</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p class="MsoNormal" style="background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;"><b><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">National Funding, Inc.,&nbsp;the parent and servicing&nbsp;company of&nbsp;</span></b><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><o:p></o:p></span></p><div><b style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Quick Bridge Funding, LLC</span></b></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: arial;">9820 Towne Centre Drive</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial">San Diego, CA 92121</font></div></div></div>]]></td>
